    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5982" root="جفل" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَفَّالٌ</span></b>  an intensive epithet from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَفَلَ</span> in the first
of the senses explained above; i.e., A camel <i>that
takes fright,</i> or <i>shies, and flees,</i> &amp;c., <i>much,</i> or
<i>often.</i> (Msb.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَفْلَانُ</span>.]

